      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003EOystrys in grauy bastard.\u003C/b\u003E Take grete Oystrys, an schale them; an take the water of the Oystrys, \u0026 ale, an bread y-straynid, an the water also, an put it on a pot, an ginger, sugar, Saffron, powder pepper, and Salt, an let it boil well; then put yn the Oystrys thereto, and dresse it forth.\u003Cbr\u003E"
